      "body": "The current player log isn't interactive.\r\n\r\nWhen there are lots of players the Game Designer may wish to sort or filter some columns.\r\n\r\nWe should switch the table to the `react-table` component.\r\n\r\nIt should include these capabilities:\r\n- sort on all colums\r\n- click on column headers to filter values in that column.  This should be for `force`, `role ` and `last message` columns. When new data is received, the filter should still be in place.  Plus, there should be some visual indication that a column has a filter applied.",
